cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this model, please cite it as below."
title: "Hippocampal index-and-replay model"
abstract: "A minimal, numerically validated trisynaptic hippocampal circuit (EC-DG-CA3-CA2-CA1-subiculum) reproducing sparse coding, PV-titrated hypersynchrony, septal theta control, orthogonal index binding, and ACh-gated encoding/replay. Self-contained; runs headlessly and in the browser."
